# MP_A5R ADDENDUM 2 -- PROPOSED REPAIRS, **NOT APPLIED**.
#
# The two frozen instruments are BYTE-UNCHANGED on disk; this file is a diff for the
# dafoam-supervisor to read AS A DIFF, personally (SUPERVISION_CHARTER.md Sec.3 check 1,
# not delegable).  Rationale: ADDENDUM_2_DRAFT_LAUNCH_PRECONDITIONS.md Sec.A2.1, A2.2.
#
# Apply, if and only if the supervisor decides to, from this directory:
#     patch -p1 -d . < mpa5r_addendum2_NOT_APPLIED.diff
# (the a/ and b/ prefixes are the file's own basenames; -p1 strips them)
#
# Built against, and only valid against:
#     mpa5r_stage_and_run.sh   md5 a6a9761613e71e0c9c29b40f40d9bf6a
#     mpa5r_run_script.py      md5 36ec1afa94c28347419042f4aaad543b
# which is the state at commit d72bee62aa07f89a48b35a8dae21f9cfda089f2c and on disk.
#
# CHECKED ON THE EDITED COPIES, NEVER ON THE ORIGINALS: `bash -n` clean on the shell
# script, `python3 -m py_compile` clean on the run script.  NEITHER HAS BEEN EXECUTED.
#
# FOUR HUNKS, and what each is for:
#   1. --user 0:0 -> -u 1000:1000 --group-add 1002 -e MPLCONFIGDIR=/tmp  (Sanaa item 6)
#   2. mpirun --allow-run-as-root -> mpirun            (no longer root; keeps it honest)
#   3. chmod 777 "$BASE" -> chmod 2775                 (777 was only ever a uid workaround)
#   4. recorder except -> REFUSE, plus hist_file / hotstart_file  (Sanaa checkpoint item 2)
#
# NO GATE, THRESHOLD, BAND, WEIGHT, SCENARIO OR LABEL IS TOUCHED BY ANY HUNK.
--- a/mpa5r_stage_and_run.sh	2026-09-12 18:41:42.672029566 +0000
